      "widgets_values": [
        "EXACTLY five boys aged 11 to 12 from Kerala standing in a ragged line on a muddy paddy-field pitch, no sixth person, no extra people, five people only. Each boy's face and identity EXACTLY like his reference image: reference image 1 = first boy, reference image 2 = second boy, reference image 3 = third boy, reference image 4 = fourth boy, reference image 5 = fifth boy, the tallest, on the far right - all five faces clearly different, matching their references, five different heights. They wear mismatched faded football jerseys: red, green goalkeeper's with gloves, yellow, white, orange - none of the kits matching, no black, some in rubber sandals. A hand-painted bedsheet banner with a round open-hand emblem hanging from two bamboo poles behind them. Wet green paddy and coconut palms behind, low golden late-afternoon light, shot like a documentary still, natural skin texture with no smoothing, soft honest lighting, shallow depth of field, subtle film grain, true-to-life colour",
        1344,
        768
      ],
      "widgets_values_named": {
        "prompt": "A 26-year-old Indian man with wavy black hair, slim build, wearing a plain black t-shirt. EXACTLY in the pose of the second reference image: same body position, arm and hand placement, head angle, and balance. Keep the face and identity EXACTLY like the first reference image. [SCENE: e.g. running through a wet village street at golden hour, camera tracking from the side, cinematic, photorealistic]",
        "width": 2560,
        "height": 1440
      }
